{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"why\": \"H2已建立亲近带来的温柔满足，H3已建立满足后的放松与享受；S04-B1中熟悉的亲密声线再现，且比先前更华丽、更迫切。解释把再次感受到亲近作为情意加深、活力被唤起的原因，可以说明歌声为何从先前的舒缓转向更饱满、更外放的表达，并非只宣布情绪变强。这里没有虚构人物经历或额外事件。不过，‘畅快’主要对应情绪舒展、活力增强的一面，对迫切中夹杂的紧张和不舍解释力有限，不能把整段听成单纯的欢畅。\",\n  \"coverage_gaps\": [\n    \"S04-B1：反复诉说、忍不住补充细节的急切感，以及情绪为何有些收不住。\",\n    \"S04-B2：高处颤抖、近乎哽咽的脆弱感，以及情绪达到炽热顶点后仍未稳稳落下、反而逐渐退弱的矛盾。\",\n    \"S04-B3：亲近中不自觉地握紧、试图抓牢当下的隐约害怕，以及越想抓紧越感到不稳。\",\n    \"S04-B4：美好仍在发生却已提前舍不得的酸楚，以及时间不断流逝带来的甜蜜与失落并存。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "13470127-b0e8-43af-ab5b-7a9a5438c653", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045445901830Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.969, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:55:23.878861+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c06a8f50b33e515858aa5bf447ba01d25a6e68ce157913fa2d3dd24d208f3b82", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc422